{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"overall\": [\"C5\", \"C1\", \"C4\", \"C3\", \"C2\"],\n  \"keep\": [\"C5\", \"C1\", \"C3\", \"C4\", \"C2\"],\n  \"cover\": [\"C1\", \"C5\", \"C3\", \"C4\", \"C2\"],\n  \"lean\": [\"C4\", \"C5\", \"C1\", \"C2\", \"C3\"],\n  \"plain\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C5\", \"C4\", \"C3\"],\n  \"why\": \"overall：C5最完整地串起退回安宁的旧想法、行动与依恋的重新结合、温柔可能受损、旧日快乐重现及未来仍会动摇；C1的情绪转折更自然，C4更利落，C3较重复，C2则遗漏较多历史因果。keep：C5同时保留行动的必要性、坚持方式不能耗损所爱、快乐不应成为逃避以及愿望未成不否定旧日快乐等关键内容；C1更明确写出责任与依恋并存而不必羞愧，但没有说透不应拿快乐来躲开眼前的事。cover：C1最清楚地解释了行动为何让旧愿变近、为何重新高兴却仍有不安，并以松开绷紧的劲解释末尾的回落；C5次之，C3对现实尚未改变及努力成效不明交代得更全，C2的因果支撑较薄。lean：C4各条推进相对独立，重复和多余步骤最少；C5略把重尝快乐与快乐过后的担忧拆成相邻两步，C3则对现实未变、生活未回来和努力成效不明重复最多。plain：C1最像一个人在讲自己的经历，尤其“退回安宁”“妨碍它的事仍会继续”“把绷着的劲松下来”具体而自然；C2也较直白，C5有几处长句略显编排感，C3最像在分析和总结心理。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "38166649-668f-4efe-8a2a-e988cd089309", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T220604019964Z", "elapsed_seconds": 210.329, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T22:09:34.365420+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "50a4615361ae864612aeec3259328f92c9a56d40e33861a12371a689f5eee090", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss